[Max All Skill Levels]
author=IRISHDEVELOPERDEV (ported to PAL from Code Master's NTSC-U CodeBreaker 'Advanced Game Variable' codes; hook address verified in the PAL ELF)
description=[UNTESTED] Maxes Fighting, Shooting, Health/Toughness, Speed and Street Smarts (level 10) and sets Respect level to 50, automatically, no button press. Works by hooking the game's stat-reading routine (PAL 0x0028FBCC, USA 0x0028FBBC) and returning max values for those six stats; every other stat reads normally.
// Code cave at 0x000C0100 (13 instructions) + override table at 0x000C0180 (6 x {hash, float}).
// Hashes = lowercase x65599 of the stat name: respect_level, melee_level, shooting_level, defense_level, speed_level (+ Street Smarts hash from the USA list).
patch=1,EE,200C0100,extended,3C04000C
patch=1,EE,200C0104,extended,24840180
patch=1,EE,200C0108,extended,24060000
patch=1,EE,200C010C,extended,8C810000
patch=1,EE,200C0110,extended,14250002
patch=1,EE,200C0114,extended,8C810004
