[Police Heat Always Zero (Safe)]
author=IRISHDEVELOPERDEV (custom, v2 of Police Heat Always Zero, checked against the PAL ELF SLES_539.67)
description=[UNTESTED] Keeps police heat at zero in every neighbourhood by writing 0 straight into each neighbourhood's heat value every frame, without calling the game's heat routine. The first version called that routine every frame, which can fire police events mid-update and was the likely cause of a freeze (stale memory read). Do not enable together with the old "Police Heat Always Zero" (same hook).
// Same hook as v1 (0x0029C130, j 0x000C0400); cave moved to 0x000C0400-0x000C04C8. Calls replaced by sw $zero,0x1C($s2).
